### 1. 服务状态检查
GET http://localhost:8082/api/coze/status

### 2. 文档管理功能
POST http://localhost:8082/api/coze/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我查看文档列表",
  "userId": "user_001"
}

### 3. 日程安排功能
POST http://localhost:8082/api/coze/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "明天下午安排项目评审会议",
  "userId": "user_002"
}

### 4. 会议助手功能
POST http://localhost:8082/api/coze/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "需要安排一个团队会议讨论需求分析",
  "userId": "user_003"
}

### 5. 文档问答功能
POST http://localhost:8082/api/coze/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我生成项目计划书的摘要",
  "userId": "user_004"
}

### 6. 获取文档列表API
GET http://localhost:8082/api/coze/documents?userId=user_001

### 7. 通用办公助手
POST http://localhost:8082/api/coze/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "作为办公助手，你能帮我做什么？",
  "userId": "user_005"
}